OL,3,ARAF Fairford suspects to be released on
OL,4,Abail, head of counter-terror police
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FFive men arrested on suspicion of
OL,8,Fterror offences near RAF Fairford on
OL,9,FSunday are being released on bail, the
OL,10,Fhead of UK counter terrorism policing,
OL,11,FAssistant Commissioner Laurence Taylor
OL,12,Fsays
OL,14,FThe men - all UK nationals in their 20s
OL,15,Fwho live in London - were arrested
OL,16,Funder the Explosives Act and on
OL,17,Fsuspicion of preparing a terrorist act.
OL,18,FBBC Verify has looked at the "company"
OL,19,Fvans seen nearby
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
