OL,3,ARAF Fairford suspects to be released on
OL,4,Abail, head of counter-terror police
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FCounter-terror police say they are
OL,8,F"very aware of the levels of
OL,9,Fspeculation about the motivation behind
OL,10,Fthis incident, and the geopolitical
OL,11,Fquestions that are being raised". The
OL,12,FIranian embassy in the UK denies any
OL,13,Finvolvement
OL,15,FEarlier, a farmer who called 999 when
OL,16,Fshe saw "a large group of hooded and
OL,17,Fmasked men" said she "foiled" their
OL,18,Fplans - here's the WhatsApp she sent
OL,19,Fher neighbours at 01:49 on Sunday
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
