OL,3,ARAF Fairford suspects to be released on
OL,4,Abail, head of counter-terror police
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut Defence Secretary Wes Streeting
OL,8,Fsaid the farmer only had a "partial
OL,9,Fpicture", while declining to speculate
OL,10,Fon the possible Iranian links
OL,12,FThe RAF base is used by the US
OL,13,Fmilitary. President Trump said the US
OL,14,Fhad the five men "under view for a long
OL,15,Ftime, and we got them"
OL,17,FPeople living nearby say security had
OL,18,Fbeen ramped up before the arrests - one
OL,19,Fperson says they were told to show
OL,20,Ftheir hands by armed US personnel
